  "translation": "I y'olu seere walasa k'olu segin i ka Tora kan, nka u jatigɛyara, u ma mɛn i ka lasigidaw la, u nana jurumu kɛ i ka sariya kɔrɔdɔnw la, minnu mɔgɔ bɛ kɛ, a bɛ balo o la; u bɛ konbɔlan di min bɛ bin, u kisilen olu lawolow, u ma mɛn.",
